  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_7292.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ondaenforma SL, la empresa que gestiona la piscina cubierta de Onda, ha organizado la tarde de este jueves la fiesta de la primavera. De manera gratuita, las personas asistentes han podido probar el AquaGym.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaprimaverapiscinacobertaonda/img_7292.jpg\" alt=\"img_7292\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaprimaverapiscinacobertaonda/img_7293.jpg\" alt=\"img_7293\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaprimaverapiscinacobertaonda/img_7295.jpg\" alt=\"img_7295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaprimaverapiscinacobertaonda/img_7296.jpg\" alt=\"img_7296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaprimaverapiscinacobertaonda/img_7297.jpg\" alt=\"img_7297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaprimaverapiscinacobertaonda/img_7298.jpg\" alt=\"img_7298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaprimaverapiscinacobertaonda/img_7299.jpg\" alt=\"img_7299\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaprimaverapiscinacobertaonda/img_7301.jpg\" alt=\"img_7301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaprimaverapiscinacobertaonda/img_7302.jpg\" alt=\"img_7302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912